{
  "name": "01 - Intake / Telegram Import",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node-0003",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Telegram Import\n\nSingle Responsibility: receive raw Telegram updates for a SEPARATE, n8n-only bot and hand them to 02 - Processing / Parse Transaction.\n\n⚠️ MUST use a bot token distinct from the app's own TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN. The app already registers a webhook on that bot at /api/integrations/telegram/webhook (with its own secret, chat allowlist, and chat→user mapping) — Telegram only allows one webhook URL per bot token, so pointing this workflow at the same token would silently hijack the app's existing integration.\n\nUses a plain Webhook node (not the native Telegram Trigger) so no n8n credential object is required — consistent with how 04-notifications calls the Telegram HTTP API directly.\n\nOne-time setup, after creating a second bot via @BotFather and setting N8N_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN:\n  curl -X POST \"https://api.telegram.org/bot$N8N_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN/setWebhook?url=<your-n8n-instance>/webhook/budgetflow/telegram-import\"\n\nOptional allowlist: set N8N_TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_CHAT_IDS (comma-separated chat IDs) to restrict who can post through this bot. If unset, ANY chat that messages this bot can create transactions — set it before relying on this in production.\n\nStays inactive until N8N_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN is configured and the webhook above is registered.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0004",
      "name": "Telegram Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        360
      ],
      "webhookId": "node-0005",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "budgetflow/telegram-import",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0006",
      "name": "Normalize Telegram Update",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        520,
        360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const update = ($input.first() && $input.first().json && $input.first().json.body) || {};\nconst message = update.message || update.edited_message || {};\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    source: \"TELEGRAM\",\n    rawText: message.text || \"\",\n    chatId: message.chat ? String(message.chat.id) : null,\n    senderHint: message.from ? (message.from.username || message.from.first_name || null) : null,\n    receivedAt: message.date ? new Date(message.date * 1000).toISOString() : new Date().toISOString(),\n  },\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0007",
      "name": "Has Text?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "node-0008",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.rawText }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0009",
      "name": "Allowed Chat?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1080,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "node-0010",
              "leftValue": "={{ $env.N8N_TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_CHAT_IDS }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "empty"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "node-0011",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($env.N8N_TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_CHAT_IDS || '').split(',').map(s => s.trim()).includes($json.chatId) }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0012",
      "name": "Parse Transaction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1360,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "SELECT_AFTER_IMPORT:02 - Processing / Parse Transaction",
          "cachedResultName": "02 - Processing / Parse Transaction"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "After importing, point this at the \"02 - Processing / Parse Transaction\" workflow (n8n assigns IDs on import). Failures are relayed back into this same Telegram chat automatically — the chatId flows through the whole pipeline and 04-notifications replies to it directly."
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0013",
      "name": "Success?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1640,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "node-0014",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0015",
      "name": "Send Success Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1920,
        180
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'https://api.telegram.org/bot' + $env.N8N_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN + '/sendMessage' }}",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": false,
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json",
              "fullResponse": false
            }
          }
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ ({ \"chat_id\": $('Normalize Telegram Update').item.json.chatId, \"text\": ('✅ Imported: ' + $json.amount + ' — ' + $('Normalize Telegram Update').item.json.rawText) }) }}"
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Telegram Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Normalize Telegram Update",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Normalize Telegram Update": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Has Text?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Has Text?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Allowed Chat?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Allowed Chat?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Parse Transaction",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Parse Transaction": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Success?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Success?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Success Reply",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveManualExecutions": true
  },
  "tags": []
}
